---
import Layout from '@/layouts/Layout.astro';
import { site } from '@/data/site';
import brandBrainBee from '../../../asset/individual-bees/06-brand-second-brain-no-name.png';
const interestUrl = site.bookingUrl;
---
<Layout>
<div class="growth-page">
<section class="growth-page-hero shell"><a class="text-link" href="/products">← All products</a><p class="eyebrow-accent">MLABS SKILL MANAGER · IN DEVELOPMENT</p><h1>MLabs Skill Manager.<br /><em>AI skills, organised.<br />Recurring work, planned.</em></h1><p class="growth-lead">You rebuild the same routine in a new chat every week, and the context dies with the tab. Skill Manager is being developed as one place to keep the instructions, schedule the recurring run, and inspect the output before anyone acts on it.</p><div class="growth-actions"><a class="growth-button" href={interestUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-cta-location="product-interest-hero">Book a product call ↗</a><a class="text-link" href="#how-it-works">See the workflow ↓</a></div><p class="growth-note">Choose a time for a 30-minute call on Calendly. No product purchase is required.</p></section>
<section id="how-it-works" class="section-space growth-evidence"><div class="shell growth-split"><div><h2 class="section-title">Give recurring work<br /><span class="muted-heading">a home.</span></h2><p>A skill is a set of instructions for a repeatable AI task. Skill Manager brings the instructions, project context, schedule and resulting work into an organised workflow.</p><p>For example: prepare a recurring content review from approved brand material, then inspect the draft before deciding what to publish. This describes a possible workflow, not a promise that every integration is available.</p></div><figure class="growth-diagram"><img src={brandBrainBee.src} width="640" height="640" alt="Organise project context, schedule a task, then review the output before taking action." loading="lazy" /><figcaption>Concept illustration · human review remains part of the workflow</figcaption></figure></div></section>
<section class="section-space shell"><div class="growth-split"><article><p class="eyebrow-accent">WHO IT IS FOR</p><h2 class="section-title">You already know<br />what needs repeating.</h2><ul class="growth-list"><li>You use AI for recurring audits, research or content work.</li><li>You need to keep project instructions and outputs organised.</li><li>You want a review step before work reaches customers.</li></ul></article><article class="growth-card"><p class="eyebrow-accent">BEFORE YOU PLAN A PURCHASE</p><h2 class="growth-card-title">What is decided. What is still open.</h2><dl class="growth-details"><div><dt>Product status</dt><dd>In development. No public paid release is available here.</dd></div><div><dt>Delivery</dt><dd>The current application runs locally on a desktop. Public platform support and setup requirements are still being finalised.</dd></div><div><dt>Pricing & access</dt><dd>Monthly and lifetime options are being considered. Neither pricing nor included updates, skills and support has been announced.</dd></div><div><dt>Other tools</dt><dd>AI runtimes and third-party services may require their own accounts and fees. Compatibility will be stated with the release.</dd></div></dl></article></div></section>
<section class="section-space growth-product-band"><div class="shell growth-callout"><div><h2>Tell Mehul what you want to repeat.</h2><p>Share the task, your current tools, and what a useful output looks like. It shapes what gets built, and you hear first when it ships. This is a product conversation; no service audit required, nothing to buy.</p></div><a class="growth-button" href={interestUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-cta-location="product-interest-bottom">Book a product call ↗</a></div></section>
</div></Layout>
